<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Finance to issue five mln shares.</title>
<headline>Keppel Finance to issue five mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Finance Ltd, part of Keppel Corp, said on Monday it proposed to issue five million new ordinary shares at a price of Singapore $1.68 each.</p>
<p>Keppel Finance said the new shares would be privately placed with investors if approval for the issue was received from the Stock Exchange of Singapore.</p>
<p>The company said it intended to use the proceeds to finance redevelopment of its branch at Carpenter Street in Singapore into its head office.</p>
<p>Keppel Finance shares closed at S$1.68 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
